{\rtlch\af2\alang1025\afs24\ltrch\b\i\fs20\lang1033\langnp1033\langfe1033\langfenp1033\loch\af2\dbch\af2\hich\f2\strike0\ul\cf2 technologies}{\rtlch\af2\alang1025\afs24\ltrch\b0\i0\fs20\lang1033\langnp1033\langfe1033\langfenp1033\loch\af2\dbch\af2\hich\f2\strike0
\ulnone\cf2 . More than 70 percent of learners who start at the academy go on to complete the program. Free, intensive four-week courses on the fundamentals of app development are also available through the Apple Foundation Programs at the academy, offered by MSU, Henry Ford College, and the College for Creative Studies.}
{\rtlch\afs24\ltrch\fs24\par}\pard\plain\itap0\s0\aspalpha\aspnum\adjustright\ltrpar\li0\lin0\ri0\rin0\ql\faauto\rtlch\afs24\ltrch\fs24{\rtlch\afs24\ltrch\fs24\par}\pard\plain\itap0\s0\fi0\sa0\aspalpha\aspnum\adjustright\ltrpar\li0\lin0\ri0\rin0\qj
