{\rtlch\af2\alang1025\afs24\ltrch\b\i\fs20\lang1033\langnp1033\langfe1033\langfenp1033\loch\af2\dbch\af2\hich\f2\strike0\ul\cf2 technology}{\rtlch\af2\alang1025\afs24\ltrch\b0\i0\fs20\lang1033\langnp1033\langfe1033\langfenp1033\loch\af2\dbch\af2\hich\f2\strike0
\ulnone\cf2  in classrooms, conferences, churches, and large events, Mansoor and his team realized there was a much greater need for a well-designed one-to-many platform built specifically for live audiences. That led to the creation of ConferenceCaptioning, a separate product focused on live event accessibility and multilingual communication. The product doesn't need the internet to work and is designed with critical event production reliability and integration in mind.}
